data sources  : the manifest record lists no API data source, but the web page IS data-bound — it reads
                useVampireDrainStats (GET /vampire-drain/stats?vehicle_id={id}), already exposed by the shared
                S8 EnergyStore. So the port binds that single feed (+ SettingsStore locale + the app-scoped
                SelectedVehicleStore) through a ViewModel exposing StateFlow<UiState>. The view performs NO HTTP
                (ADR-002/ADR-004). The /vampire-drain/stats route is a legacy endpoint whose fields are
                percentages + an already-kWh figure (NOT SI watt-hours), so — exactly like the web — no SI scaling
                is applied; percentages/legacy kWh render verbatim (unit-conversion.instructions).
  - useVampireDrainStats  GET /vampire-drain/stats?vehicle_id={id}  -> EnergyStore.vampireDrainStats(id)
                          seam: VampireDrainPageSource.vampireDrainStats (VampireDrainPageSource.kt L33)

files created :
  VampireDrainPageModel.kt      framework-free: VampireDrainPageRegistration, VampireDrainEntry/Daily/Stats,
                                parseVampireStats, VampireDisplayPrefs (rate/energyKwh/percent/score/duration +
                                locale number/date fmt), drainScoreTier/drainLossTier, sortVampireEntries,
                                recordVampireDrainOpened, mapData. JVM-unit-testable.
  VampireDrainPageSource.kt     seam + vampireDrainPageSourceOf(energyStore, settingsStore, selectedVehicleStore).
  VampireDrainPageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel: stats StateFlow<UiState<VampireDrainStats>> (flatMapLatest over
                                the selected vehicle), displayPrefs, refresh/retry/recordViewOpened.
  VampireDrainPageIcons.kt      VampireGlyphs: reuse Bolt(Zap)/Clock from the shared data-display catalog; author
                                Activity/BatteryWarning/Lightbulb/ShieldAlert locally as 24x24 stroked vectors.
  VampireDrainPage.kt           stateless Compose render layer: chrome (title/subtitle/freshness/VehicleSelect) +
                                stats-gated body (loader/error/9 panels) + RadialGauge + Line/Bar chart wrappers +
                                sortable DataTable + tips.
  VampireDrainPageHost.kt       PageHosts.register("vampireDrain") for the /vampire-drain destination.
  res/values/vampire_drain_strings.xml  app-owned literal-key labels absent from the generated translation_*
                                catalog (web renders the i18next fallback in every locale); English-only in values/
                                so ar/he fall back to it, reproducing the web exactly (preset_gallery precedent).
  test/.../VampireDrainPageModelTest.kt  10 JVM tests: decode, tiers, sort, formatters, registration identity.

